 * @param {string[]} mine
 * @param {string[]} base
 * @param {string[]} theirs
 * @returns {Array<object>} Ordered regions, each either
 *   `{ kind: 'stable', lines }`,
 *   `{ kind: 'mine'|'theirs'|'both', lines }`, or
 *   `{ kind: 'conflict', mineLines, baseLines, theirsLines }`.
