 * Evaluates a formula AST (see formula-parser.js) against a sheet.
 *
 * A range node is only a valid *value* directly as a function argument;
 * encountered anywhere else it evaluates to #ERR!, though it is still
 * walked for dependency purposes (see deps.js).
